#: scenario9:scenario9_1E9F04AC_24CD_462E_9AC3_D4184EABDCD7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 22b8662077ecd3713f79e5ec827442b8d23bf72a4c73c93e51ab8a0e46e870b6
